  "review": "Worker cutover: inspectorCard replaces showInspect scans; visualSettlement transports building IDs only on layout change; installPresentation reattaches display objects; groundPick scans projected churchyards on click; refreshOverlayNow sorts numeric property-value results. Court grazing: one owner pass only when the existing monthly livestock reckoning finds overstocking, plus one holding pass; no per-family search, persistent index or new daily census. Assize receipts use payCrafts' existing payee loop.",
  "reviewedMoves": [
